{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 1781 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "66f492725b1cae8a918562eed607f4dada1e704465f695572da13c4fbe035285" :edb/db-before-t 1780 :edb/db-after-t 1781 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535093 50 #inst "2026-10-08T16:41:52.301Z" 13194139535093 true] [17592186064148 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330924 13194139535093 true] [17592186064156 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330917 13194139535093 true] [17592186064156 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330930 13194139535093 true] [17592186330917 1017 #edb/ref 17592186330918 13194139535093 true] [17592186330917 1089 "q-114894" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330917 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535093 true] [17592186330917 1100 "${\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{2x+5}{3x-1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330917 1113 #uuid "75fc371f-8716-5cc5-91fc-744fef7a12f0" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330917 1145 "First, we pull out the factor of $3$ from the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{2x+5}{3x-1}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{2x+5}{3(x-\\frac{1}{3})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{2x+5}{(x-\\frac{1}{3})}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we draw up our synthetic division table to decompose the integrand into its quotient and remainder.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & x & {x}^{0} \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & 2 & 5 \\\\  & ↓ & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & 2 & \\frac{17}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2x+5}{(x-\\frac{1}{3})} & =2+\\frac{(\\frac{17}{3})}{(x-\\frac{1}{3})} \\\\  & =2+\\frac{17}{3(x-\\frac{1}{3})} \\\\  & =2+\\frac{17}{3x-1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{2x+5}{3x-1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}(2+\\frac{17}{3x-1})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[2{\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\text{d}x+17{\\int }_{-1}^{0}\\frac{1}{3x-1}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{[2x+\\frac{17}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3x-1|]}_{-1}^{0} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[2(0-(-1))+\\frac{17}{3}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3(0)-1|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|3(-1)-1|)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[2(1)+\\frac{17}{3}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡1-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[2-\\frac{17}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({2}^{2})] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[2-\\frac{34}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡2] \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9}[3-17\\operatorname{ln}⁡2].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330919 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330920 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330921 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330922 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330923 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1041 "selection" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330922 13194139535093 true] [17592186330918 1110 #uuid "5b4e9d14-301b-524f-bf1c-982b0aaeaefb" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330919 1034 "\\frac{1}{9}[3-11\\operatorname{ln}⁡2]" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330919 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535093 true] [17592186330919 1111 #uuid "38ecf4bc-a696-5a90-a77a-c4aa468bb831" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330920 1034 "\\frac{5}{2}[4-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡3]" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330920 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535093 true] [17592186330920 1111 #uuid "d7917112-ee1f-5168-bd9d-00dad674a524" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330921 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}[17-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡3]" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330921 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535093 true] [17592186330921 1111 #uuid "1aaec8e7-d9e0-5056-846b-59b6f661819b" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330922 1034 "\\frac{2}{9}[3-17\\operatorname{ln}⁡2]" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330922 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535093 true] [17592186330922 1111 #uuid "9f406faf-a81b-5420-82b1-a3036155282d" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330923 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}[1-17\\operatorname{ln}⁡2]" 13194139535093 true] [17592186