)}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we draw up our synthetic division table to decompose the integrand into its quotient and remainder.\n\n|  | ${x}^{1}$ | ${x}^{0}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $-\\frac{1}{5}$ | $8$ | $-7$ |\n|  | $↓$ | $-\\frac{8}{5}$ |\n|  | $8$ | $-\\frac{43}{5}$ |\n\nSo, from the synthetic division, we get that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{8x-7}{(x+\\frac{1}{5})} & =8-\\frac{(\\frac{43}{5})}{(x+\\frac{1}{5})} \\\\  & =8-\\frac{43}{5x+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{8x-7}{5x+1}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{5}{\\int }_{0}^{1}(8-\\frac{43}{5x+1})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}[8{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\text{d}x-43{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{1}{5x+1}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}{[8x-\\frac{43}{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|5x+1|]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}[8(1-0)-\\frac{43}{5}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|6|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|1|)] \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{5}-\\frac{43}{25}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(6).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330931 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330932 13194139535093 true] [17592186330931 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330933 13194139535093 true] [17592186330931 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535093 true] [17592186330931 1041 "field-1" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330931 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330933 13194139535093 true] [17592186330931 1110 #uuid "2199637e-731f-5a4c-80a3-5b917b9eb88d" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330932 1034 "\\frac{7}{5}" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330932 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535093 true] [17592186330932 1111 #uuid "c50146ee-33ff-540f-aeef-7e0308168805" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330933 1034 "\\frac{8}{5}" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330933 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535093 true] [17592186330933 1111 #uuid "20d215d5-09cd-57a3-a85f-0ce8084bb08d" 13194139535093 true] [17592186330934 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330935 13194139535093 true] [17592186330934 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535093 true] [17592186330934 1041 "field-2" 131941395350